# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PUBLIC REPOSITORY SAFETY FENCE
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This Git repository points to the PUBLIC snipfor.com/web-download repository.
# SnipFor application source must NEVER be committed or pushed from here.
# Source versioning belongs in a separate PRIVATE repository.
#
# Tracked website/media files remain tracked even when broad rules are added
# below. The rules prevent an accidental `git add .` from collecting application
# sources that currently share this working directory with the public website.

# Python application source and tests
*.py
*.pyw
*.pyi
*.qrc
SnipForImage/
SnipForImageViewer/
tests/
lang/

# Build, installer and enterprise source definitions
*.spec
*.iss
*.wxs
*.wxi
*.reg
*.ps1
installer-msix/
assets/
dev_tools/

# Private architecture, product and internal project documentation
docs/
AGENTS.md
PROJE_*.md
SNIPFOR_PROJE_OZETI.md
SnipFor_Ozellikler.md
Implementation Plan.md

# Local source-repository migration and safety metadata
repository-policy.toml
.private-repo-confirmed
